obs The hot pass carries two reds and they are one peer guard with its roster echo. mantra_snapshot_hosted read red at 2689ms under a loaded pier and GREEN alone on metal straight after. Its evidence names BadKind in decode_request and then RecvFailed, and a datagram of the WRONG KIND is a foreign sender rather than a lost packet: mantra/snapshot_export_delivery.rye binds fetcher_port 38490 and source_port 38491 with no port lock, on a pier where eight trees run the same guard. %485's shape, and the cure stands one lane over in tools/fixtures/a/amphora_vessel_port_lock.sh. Handed to the mantra lane rather than repaired from here.
